 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.3,
   "text": "In this town, the fastest kid wins a trophy. Every single year."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.slow",
   "start": 3.3,
   "end": 4.8333,
   "text": "And I was the slowest kid in town."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.baby",
   "start": 4.8333,
   "end": 7.4,
   "text": "A baby villager could beat me. One did. Twice."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.want",
   "start": 7.4,
   "end": 9.7,
   "text": "I had wanted that trophy since I was ten years old."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.now",
   "start": 9.7,
   "end": 12.0333,
   "text": "Now I was eighteen. And my shelf was still empty."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.train",
   "start": 12.0333,
   "end": 13.8667,
   "text": "So I trained. Every single day."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.hill",
   "start": 13.8667,
   "end": 15.7667,
   "text": "I ran up the hill. I ran round the pond."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.push",
   "start": 15.7667,
   "end": 17.2,
   "text": "I did push ups. I did one."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.sweat",
   "start": 17.2,
   "end": 19.3667,
   "text": "I sweated so much that the chickens moved away from me."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.fail",
   "start": 19.3667,
   "end": 22.6,
   "text": "And every single day, I lost. To the same baby."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.week",
   "start": 22.6,
   "end": 26.2,
   "text": "The race was one week away. I had to get fast, and I had to do it quickly."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.night",
   "start": 26.2,
   "end": 28.1,
   "text": "That night, I could not sleep."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.forest",
   "start": 28.1,
   "end": 31.1667,
   "text": "So I went out to the forest, alone, and I trained in the dark."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.tired",
   "start": 31.1667,
   "end": 34.1,
   "text": "I ran until my legs gave up. Then I lay down in the leaves."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.witch",
   "start": 34.1,
   "end": 37.6,
   "text": "That is when I saw her. A witch, behind a tree, waving at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.win",
   "start": 37.6,
   "end": 39.4,
   "text": "\"Do you want to win?\" she said."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.yes",
   "start": 39.4,
   "end": 44.0333,
   "text": "I thought about my mum, and my dad, and that empty shelf. \"Yes,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.shoes",
   "start": 44.0333,
   "end": 45.6,
   "text": "She took out a pair of shoes."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.money",
   "start": 45.6,
   "end": 47.2333,
   "text": "\"But I have no money,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.free",
   "start": 47.2333,
   "end": 50.1,
   "text": "\"No worries,\" said the witch. \"I am just trying to get rid of them.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.hmm",
   "start": 50.1,
   "end": 51.8333,
   "text": "That should have worried me. It did not."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.stump",
   "start": 51.8333,
   "end": 53.9333,
   "text": "I sat down on a tree stump, and I put them on."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.gone",
   "start": 53.9333,
   "end": 55.9333,
   "text": "When I looked up, the witch was gone."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.love",
   "start": 55.9333,
   "end": 58.2,
   "text": "I did not care. I loved my new shoes."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.run",
   "start": 58.2,
   "end": 59.0667,
   "text": "So I ran."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.slow",
   "start": 59.0667,
   "end": 60.4,
   "text": "And the whole world slowed down."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.leaf",
   "start": 60.4,
   "end": 62.7333,
   "text": "A leaf hung in the air, right in front of my nose."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.bird",
   "start": 62.7333,
   "end": 64.8667,
   "text": "A bird hung in the sky with its wings open."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.real",
   "start": 64.8667,
   "end": 68.2667,
   "text": "But the world was not slow. I was fast. I was running at the speed of light!"
  },
  {
   "id": "5.pond",
   "start": 68.2667,
   "end": 70.0,
   "text": "I ran across the pond. On top of it."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.cheat",
   "start": 70.0,
   "end": 72.7,
   "text": "Then I stopped. This was cheating. And everybody would know."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.off",
   "start": 72.7,
   "end": 76.5,
   "text": "So I took the shoes off. And on the side of one, I saw three buttons."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.one",
   "start": 76.5,
   "end": 79.6,
   "text": "The first one was on. It said, light speed."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.two",
   "start": 79.6,
   "end": 83.9333,
   "text": "I pressed the second one, and I ran. It was still much too fast. I went through a bush."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.three",
   "start": 83.9333,
   "end": 86.1667,
   "text": "So I pressed the third one, and I ran again."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.right",
   "start": 86.1667,
   "end": 89.7333,
   "text": "Fast. But not too fast. It was perfect. Nobody would suspect a thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.week",
   "start": 89.7333,
   "end": 91.5333,
   "text": "One week later, I was on the start line."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.long",
   "start": 91.5333,
   "end": 95.5,
   "text": "It was a long race, in four parts. Out of the village, and over to the rivers."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.far",
   "start": 95.5,
   "end": 98.9,
   "text": "Then across the desert, through the dark oak forest, and into the next village."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.rest",
   "start": 98.9,
   "end": 101.7333,
   "text": "After every part, you could rest, and wait for the others."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.twenty",
   "start": 101.7333,
   "end": 105.2,
   "text": "There were twenty other runners. Players, villagers, and that baby."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.sign",
   "start": 105.2,
   "end": 107.5,
   "text": "My mum and dad were there. My dad had made a sign."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.count",
   "start": 107.5,
   "end": 109.4667,
   "text": "Three. Two. One. Go!"
  },
  {
   "id": "8.fifteen",
   "start": 109.4667,
   "end": 111.4667,
   "text": "On the village road, I was in fifteenth place."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.eleven",
   "start": 111.4667,
   "end": 113.8333,
   "text": "In the wheat fields, I was eleventh. Then ninth."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.six",
   "start": 113.8333,
   "end": 117.2333,
   "text": "In the birch wood, I was sixth. I went past the baby. I waved."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.two",
   "start": 117.2333,
   "end": 120.2333,
   "text": "Then I was second! I could see the rivers. I could see the finish flag."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.one",
   "start": 120.2333,
   "end": 123.0333,
   "text": "There was only one runner in front of me. And I could not catch him."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.line",
   "start": 123.0333,
   "end": 125.0667,
   "text": "He went over the line first. I was second."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.cele",
   "start": 125.0667,
   "end": 128.6,
   "text": "Second! I had never been second at anything. I jumped. I danced."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.okay",
   "start": 128.6,
   "end": 130.7667,
   "text": "It was not first. But it was okay."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.sit",
   "start": 130.7667,
   "end": 133.6,
   "text": "So I sat down by the river, happy, and I waited for the others."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.look",
   "start": 133.6,
   "end": 135.7,
   "text": "The winner sat down too. I looked at his feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.same",
   "start": 135.7,
   "end": 137.9333,
   "text": "He was wearing the same shoes."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.sub",
   "start": 137.9333,
   "end": 139.7667,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part two."
  }
 ],
